  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8104.03 Issuance of Certificates of Occupancy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8104.03 Issuance of Certificates of Occupancy. Upon completion of the work, inspections for compliance with state and local codes by the fire marshal or designee and receipt of required documentation, a certificate of occupancy shall be issued.\n\nSource. #12022, eff 10-26-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8100.html"
